://dev.to/ashtech52/can-google-genie-4-make-a-game-a-game-developers-guide-5fod">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Top 98 Roblox 游戏数据揭示：缩略图、图标与个性化到底有多重要（2026 数据）</title><link>https://dev.to/hex_builder/what-the-top-98-roblox-games-reveal-about-thumbnails-icons-personalization-2026-data-5gm3</link><description>作者拉取了 Roblox 在线榜前 98 款游戏的公开页面数据，用真实数字验证缩略图、图标与个性化对点击的实际影响，取代凭感觉的经验谈。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:18:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">32842e98b4c463149313b38948337fc753d4e5f5</guid><source url="https://dev.to/hex_builder/what-the-top-98-roblox-games-reveal-about-thumbnails-icons-personalization-2026-data-5gm3">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>为游戏移植 Nintendo Switch 做准备：一份技术就绪清单</title><link>https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/preparing-your-game-for-a-nintendo-switch-port-a-technical-readiness-list-2a8i</link><description>想把游戏搬上 Switch？这份清单从性能、输入到提交流程逐项梳理，帮你在动手前先摸清移植要过哪些关。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:46:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2d294146dac286789e4e8b970e2ea5b5244b9334</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/preparing-your-game-for-a-nintendo-switch-port-a-technical-readiness-list-2a8i">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unreal Engine 6 将不再包含蓝图与 Gameplay Framework</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/unreal-engine-6-will-not-include-blueprints-gameplay-framework</link><description>Epic 透露 UE6 将砍掉蓝图与 Gameplay Framework，并预计 AI 能让 UE5 游戏向 UE6 的迁移变得实际又划算，引擎路线迎来大转向。</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:06:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a20486b8372ea0d23bbdc5365d5cedabe8df51d1</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/unreal-engine-6-will-not-include-blueprints-gameplay-framework">80 Level</source></item><item><title>本周手游五件大事：《GTA 6》开局爆火、Jam City 裁员与 Google Play 年度最佳</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/hot-five-gta-6s-blockbuster-launch-layoffs-at-jam-city-and-google-plays-best-of-play-2026-winners</link><description>一周手游要闻盘点：《GTA 6》首日票房级表现、Jam City 裁员，以及 Google Pl